<title>USA: Des Moines, Iowa, $16.150 mln won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Des Moines, Iowa, $16.150 mln won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $16.150 million of Des Moines, Iowa, general obligation bonds, Series 1996 E, with a true interest cost of 5.16 percent.</p>
</text>
